    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d424">

                <pb facs="1183" n="1177" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1177"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Stevens.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 29.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In connection with my No. 28.of the 9th
                    instant I inclose herewith a copy of a letter from the Secretary of the Navy,
                    dated the 10th instant, announcing that the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Pensacola</hi> has been directed to proceed to Honolulu, and to remain
                    there until further ordered.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William F. Wharton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d424-a1.xml" xpointer="d424-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
